{"id":"vod_sn_37130","vodId":"37130","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"无彩限的怪灵世界","name_cn":"无彩限的怪灵世界","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/d89b1b8b18680e01eabaaa50fdcddb85.jpg"},"summary":"在这个世界上，存在着一种名为“怪灵”的生物。故事发生在弗塞亚学院之中，在那里，设立了名为“脑机能异常对策室”的机构，专门解决怪灵带来的危险和麻烦。一条晴彦（下野紘 配音）是一年级新生，亦是对策室的成员，他拥有能够使用绘画封印怪灵的能力，是足智多谋的军师。　　川神舞（上坂堇 配音）是一条晴彦的学姐，个性开朗行事冲动的她常常惹出不少的麻烦，和晴彦组成了搭档相互取长补短居然格外的般配。除此之外，温文尔雅的千金大小姐和泉玲奈（早见沙织 配音），特立独行的孤高展示水无濑小系（内田真礼 配音），这些孩子们集结在一起，为了保护他们挚爱的朋友和家园向怪灵发起了宣战。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:49:05","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YHyFEhpbNu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kJefxy9ZSs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8Sbv82kHBN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KreMHusvpQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8ULuks3iiH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MpubFDHCEU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MK5cXcZfsw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Vn1GNFFBsY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZrEq103GUT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/E6yyemN8Pu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PGd00n3jTi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mWpYY7u4jc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0Q1WSQw9r51/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:14.473Z"}